### UStudent API - Schedule & Conflict Detection Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Check CS101 Conflicts for Student 1 (empty schedule)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/conflicts?studentId=1

### Check CS201 Conflicts for Student 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/conflicts?studentId=1

### Check MATH101 Conflicts for Student 1 (should conflict with CS101)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/3/conflicts?studentId=1

### Check Conflicts for Different Semester
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/conflicts?studentId=1&semester=SPRING2025

### Get Student 1's Current Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/schedule

### Get Student 2's Current Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/2/schedule

### Get Schedule for Specific Semester
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/schedule?semester=FALL2024

### Test Conflict Scenario: Enroll in conflicting courses
# First enroll in CS101 (MWF 9:00-10:30)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/enroll?studentId=1

###
# Then try MATH101 (MWF 9:30-11:00) - should conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/3/enroll?studentId=1

###
# Then try CS201 (TTh 11:00-12:30) - should work, no conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/enroll?studentId=1